        Root cause:
        The bug was caused by improper handling of the `link_down` state during auto-negotiation, where the link was incorrectly set to up even if it was forced down. Additionally, if auto-negotiation was in progress during migration, the link would not come up, leading to connectivity issues. The changes made in the patch address these issues by ensuring that the link status is accurately reflected based on the actual state of the network interface and by completing auto-negotiation if it was ongoing during migration.

